{"2438680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Airborne Empire", "steam_appid": 2438680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR UNIQUE FLYING CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/113e0b3f8b4dda9c8a8ca0b95a037818.poster.avif?t=1776438327\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/113e0b3f8b4dda9c8a8ca0b95a037818.webm?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/113e0b3f8b4dda9c8a8ca0b95a037818.mp4?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airborne Empire is a one-of-a-kind Open World RPG City Builder. Build and grow your own city in the skies and keep it aloft by managing its lift, balance, and propulsion. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape and grow your own unique flying city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage lift, balance, and propulsion to keep your city airborne</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your city’s defenses and abilities to defeat pesky pirates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance resources, infrastructure, and the needs of your people</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A VAST OPEN WORLD </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/19fe0229f6802564e82a5528a0af66bd.poster.avif?t=1776438327\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/19fe0229f6802564e82a5528a0af66bd.webm?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/19fe0229f6802564e82a5528a0af66bd.mp4?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a vast open world full of dangers, exotic wonders, and many hidden treasures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across 5 diverse biomes such as the lush Aeyrie, volcanic Blackspine and snowy Kingsfell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover distant kingdoms and forgotten settlements scattered across the lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky characters, uncover their stories, and trade with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests that help liberate towns and rebuild connections between kingdoms</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND THE SKIES FROM PIRATES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/350c6896d585bc73113882e13bf9390c.poster.avif?t=1776438327\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/350c6896d585bc73113882e13bf9390c.webm?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/350c6896d585bc73113882e13bf9390c.mp4?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky pirates are threatening the fragile peace. Defend your people and hunt down enemy outposts across the world.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build defensive structures to fend off pirate attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of offensive weapons such as Freeze Cannons, Tesla Cannons and Aircrafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track down pirate outposts and destroy their bases</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the kingdoms below from an assortment of pirate enemies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RESEARCH AND DISCOVER THROUGH EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/dec677cdd6c083c2b542bef060c30e77.poster.avif?t=1776438327\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/dec677cdd6c083c2b542bef060c30e77.webm?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/dec677cdd6c083c2b542bef060c30e77.mp4?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research, unlock and uncover all kinds of new technology to expand your flying city.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new lift, propulsion, and morale buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop new abilities and weapons tools to defend your city against pirate threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research upgrades that improve your city and enrich the lives of its citizens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover relics and hidden technologies across the world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW WAYS TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/beec21898c614fd0d7c0021918c1f5c6.poster.avif?t=1776438327\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/beec21898c614fd0d7c0021918c1f5c6.webm?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/beec21898c614fd0d7c0021918c1f5c6.mp4?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airborne Empire offers multiple ways to experience life in the skies depending on the challenge you seek.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong> challenges players to survive 20 escalating stages of pirate attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pacifist Mode</strong> allows players to focus on exploration and city building without combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong> offers a more difficult challenge with custom difficulty sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Mode</strong> offers unrestricted building for players who want to experiment freely</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR UNIQUE FLYING CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/113e0b3f8b4dda9c8a8ca0b95a037818.poster.avif?t=1776438327\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/113e0b3f8b4dda9c8a8ca0b95a037818.webm?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/113e0b3f8b4dda9c8a8ca0b95a037818.mp4?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airborne Empire is a one-of-a-kind Open World RPG City Builder. Build and grow your own city in the skies and keep it aloft by managing its lift, balance, and propulsion. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape and grow your own unique flying city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage lift, balance, and propulsion to keep your city airborne</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your city’s defenses and abilities to defeat pesky pirates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance resources, infrastructure, and the needs of your people</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A VAST OPEN WORLD </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/19fe0229f6802564e82a5528a0af66bd.poster.avif?t=1776438327\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/19fe0229f6802564e82a5528a0af66bd.webm?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/19fe0229f6802564e82a5528a0af66bd.mp4?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a vast open world full of dangers, exotic wonders, and many hidden treasures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across 5 diverse biomes such as the lush Aeyrie, volcanic Blackspine and snowy Kingsfell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover distant kingdoms and forgotten settlements scattered across the lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky characters, uncover their stories, and trade with them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests that help liberate towns and rebuild connections between kingdoms</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND THE SKIES FROM PIRATES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/350c6896d585bc73113882e13bf9390c.poster.avif?t=1776438327\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati