_paragraph\" >Research upgrades that improve your city and enrich the lives of its citizens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover relics and hidden technologies across the world</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW WAYS TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/beec21898c614fd0d7c0021918c1f5c6.poster.avif?t=1776438327\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/beec21898c614fd0d7c0021918c1f5c6.webm?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438680/extras/beec21898c614fd0d7c0021918c1f5c6.mp4?t=1776438327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airborne Empire offers multiple ways to experience life in the skies depending on the challenge you seek.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong> challenges players to survive 20 escalating stages of pirate attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pacifist Mode</strong> allows players to focus on exploration and city building without combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard Mode</strong> offers a more difficult challenge with custom difficulty sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Mode</strong> offers unrestricted building for players who want to experiment freely</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Build your sky city while exploring a vast landscape in this Open World RPG City Builder. Combining the methodical construction and management of a city builder; the unique lift, balance, and propulsion needed for a flying city; and the compelling characters, dangers, and adventures of an RPG!", "supported_languages": "English, German, Simplified 